Цель:
  Реализовать TRAIN-fitted missing value handling и categorical encoding.

Ссылка на предыдущий report:
  Task12-type-casting-and-schema-normalization.md

Scope:
  - Реализовать imputer fit/transform split.
  - Реализовать categorical encoding fit/transform split.
  - Fit только на TRAIN.
  - Transform TRAIN/VALIDATION/TEST с использованием TRAIN-fitted artifacts.

Missing value strategies:
  - Numeric counters: 0 только если absence semantically means zero, иначе median.
  - Numeric continuous: median.
  - Ratios: median или 0 + missing indicator.
  - Boolean: false + missing indicator.
  - Categorical: UNKNOWN.
  - Timestamp-derived: -1/UNKNOWN_TIME + timestamp_missing flag.
  - Sequence: padding + mask.

Encoding strategies:
  - One-hot для small-cardinality categories.
  - Frequency encoding для high-cardinality process/event/domain classes.
  - Hashing trick для safe high-cardinality tokens после leakage cleaning.
  - Embedding index для sequence tokens.

Forbidden categories for encoding:
  dataset_name, dataset_role, source_file, source_path, scenario_name,
  label_source, label_status, parser_name, parser_version.

Требования к реализации:
